    {
      "id": "hTIfM-xswrQ67JOermOMR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 306.96409970238096,
      "y": 675.1906098865328,
      "width": 778.7918090820312,
      "height": 1610,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1644356628,
      "version": 745,
      "versionNonce": 1162282924,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785662491841,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n1. requirement Gathering\n    a. Multicity\n    b. multiplex + single screen concepts\n    c. different types of seats, different types of screen\n\n    Out of scope:\n    a. popcorn cold drinks out of scope\n\n\n2. Core Entity\n    a. User\n    b. Movie\n    c. Booking\n    d. City\n    e. Threatre\n    f. Screen\n    g. Seat\n    h. Show\n\n\n3. API Design\n    a. GET /bookmyshow/search/<city>\n        List<Threatre>\n\n    b. GET /bookmyshow/search/<city>/<Theatre>\n        List<Show>\n\n    c. POST /bookmyshow/book\n            Request Body\n            {\n                \"show\": <Show>\n                \"seats\": List<SeatNumber>\n                \"user\": <User>\n            }\n\n            Response Body\n            {\n                \"booking\": <Booking>\n            }\n\n4. UML diagram\n\n5. Do Coding\n\n^. Discuss future scopes",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n1. requirement Gathering\n    a. Multicity\n    b. multiplex + single screen concepts\n    c. different types of seats, different types of screen\n\n    Out of scope:\n    a. popcorn cold drinks out of scope\n\n\n2. Core Entity\n    a. User\n    b. Movie\n    c. Booking\n    d. City\n    e. Threatre\n    f. Screen\n    g. Seat\n    h. Show\n\n\n3. API Design\n    a. GET /bookmyshow/search/<city>\n        List<Threatre>\n\n    b. GET /bookmyshow/search/<city>/<Theatre>\n        List<Show>\n\n    c. POST /bookmyshow/book\n            Request Body\n            {\n                \"show\": <Show>\n                \"seats\": List<SeatNumber>\n                \"user\": <User>\n            }\n\n            Response Body\n            {\n                \"booking\": <Booking>\n            }\n\n4. UML diagram\n\n5. Do Coding\n\n^. Discuss future scopes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-WQOtiwBw8lKJgUIqkRLZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 145.04904495217573,
      "y": 2690.124989998081,
      "width": 1460.7313232421875,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2111339341,
      "version": 483,
      "versionNonce": 949352375,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791267920301,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nUber Requirements\n\n1. user will be able to search ride and see estimated price for car type based on its pickup and destination\n(EstimatedFee calculation based on strategy and decorator)\n2. user should be able choose car type and price and then book ride.\n3. system should be able to allocate driver based on some strategy and allocate the driver",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nUber Requirements\n\n1. user will be able to search ride and see estimated price for car type based on its pickup and destination\n(EstimatedFee calculation based on strategy and decorator)\n2. user should be able choose car type and price and then book ride.\n3. system should be able to allocate driver based on some strategy and allocate the driver",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Rh7f7AlqdZNDG3bQM3sBQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1345.6710359213455,
      "y": 2619.851971846709,
      "width": 480.14385986328125,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 232372653,
      "version": 97,
      "versionNonce": 143386839,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791267920301,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Assumptions \n1. There will be multiple type of car",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Assumptions \n1. There will be multiple type of car",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "VI_I5XJNpR5Vav0ORw8Os",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 157.01040974389878,
      "y": 2598.9195834611946,
      "width": 541.8558349609375,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2076963779,
      "version": 144,
      "versionNonce": 48674295,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791267920301,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Out of scope\n1. Start/End trip is part of drivers app\n2. System will choose trip for me \n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Out of scope\n1. Start/End trip is part of drivers app\n2. System will choose trip for me \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "i2S_I1ILcxrX_kO_Aj6C1",
      "type": "text",
